cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VAP in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "VAP: Verified Action Protocol"
abstract: >-
  An experimental runtime and protocol between AI agents and the tools they act on. Agents see
  which actions are available, get a plan before anything runs, and receive evidence of what
  actually happened. A lost tool response is reconciled by looking the write up at the
  destination instead of retrying it blindly.
authors:
